    { q: "Can I set a stop-loss on the Tradovate mobile app?", a: "Yes. Open the order ticket, switch the order type to Stop, Stop Limit, or Trailing Stop, enter your trigger price or trail distance, and tap Send. It rests as a working order until price hits it." },
    { q: "How do I close a position on Tradovate mobile?", a: "Open Markets from the menu, scroll to the My Positions panel, and tap CANCEL ALL & EXIT ALL. That flattens the position at market and cancels any working orders attached to it." },
